The critical violations—ViolAuthorityOverreach, ViolBlockCoverageMissing, and ViolPrincipalClaimUseMissing—all require finalizer work and must be resolved. ViolEnumerationLabelUngrounded is the outlier; it can only be handled by the extractor or explorer, not the finalizer alone.
