1. `ViolKindSpec` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:68) — ViolKindSpec定义每种violation的分类属性：DefaultSeverity决定retry资格、SoftByDefault控制是否绕过gate、Promotable控制是否可被yaml提升、FallbackLocus决定修复归属阶段、FixableByAgents列出可修复的agent类型
2. `FallbackLocus` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:90) — FallbackLocus is the stage that owns the fix. DefaultFallbackPolicy() derives the FallbackTarget via targetForLocus(locus). Special loci: - LocusFinalizer: re-emit the answer document - LocusExtract: re-pick citations / re-emit symbol slate - LocusExplore: re-investigate (need new evidence)
3. `FallbackLocus` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:97) — `FallbackLocus` 每种violation kind指定的修复所有者阶段
4. `RepairLocus` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:204) — `RepairLocus` 修复目标分类：finalizer重写、extract重选、explore重新调查、terminal失败
5. `SoftByDefault` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:458) — ── Original contract-checker kinds ── 2026-05-18 commercial-gate policy: these legacy checks remain Medium/High/Critical severity for telemetry and operator strict promotion, but default SoftByDefault=true unless the signal is deterministic, cannot be system-caveated, and is certainly a
6. `RegisterViolKind` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:467) — `RegisterViolKind` SoftByDefault=true的violation类型：ViolFamilyMismatch/ViolCitation/ViolMustInclude/ViolMustExclude/ViolAcceptance/ViolSuccessCriterion等7种legacy检查默认soft，不触发retry
7. `SoftByDefault` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:467) — 2026-05-18商业门控策略：大多数legacy contract-checker violation默认SoftByDefault=true，不触发retry而是提供caveat
8. `ViolAuthorityOverreach` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:563) — ViolAuthorityOverreach: SeverityCritical, FallbackLocus=LocusFinalizer, 过度声明权威性，finalizer可重写答案文本添加hedging修复
9. `FixableByAgents` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:628) — FixableByAgents白名单：指定哪些AgentName可以修复该violation。LocusFinalizer修复需要finalizer有权限，FixableByAgents检查确保不会dispatch到无法修复的agent
10. `Implies` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:629) — `Implies` FacetUncovered → richness drops because a required facet has no block. Same root, different reporter angle.
11. `Implies` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:631) — Implies字段：标记派生violation。当ViolFacetUncovered触发时ViolRichnessRegression作为派生症状，ComputeRootCauseClosure只显示根因避免N个violation显示
12. `ViolMissingRequestedRoleUndisclosed` (internal/types/violation_registry.go:644) — ViolMissingRequestedRoleUndisclosed: FixableByAgents=[AgentFinalizer]单一agent修复，finalizer添加missing_requested_roles[]字段即可修复
