on 的 retry 行为以 yaml 配置为准，不以上述源码分析为据。"}, {"id": "summary_rec", "kind": "section", "text": "建议清单：\n\n保留（finalizer 自修复，无需 LLM retry）：ViolAuthorityOverreach、ViolPrincipalClaimUseMissing、ViolMissingRequestedRoleUndisclosed、ViolExhaustiveMemberSetCoverageDrift、ViolEnumerationLabelHallucinated、ViolInlineIdentifierHallucinated（auto_repair 覆盖）、ViolDiagramEdgeEndpointHallucinated、ViolLaneBlockKindMismatch、ViolPrincipalSupportMemberOmitted、ViolEnumerationItemLabelExtractorDrift、ViolDiagramEdgeUnsupported、ViolCurrentStatusVerdictMissing、ViolClaimFormUnsupported、ViolSelfContradiction、ViolIntentEnumerateNotList、ViolAnswerTopicMismatch（共 16 种，由 finalizer 重写答案文档修复）。\n\n已系统自动修复，无需任何 retry：ViolFacetUncovered（evidence-sufficient 场景）、ViolInlineIdentifierHallucinated（auto_repair 无需 LLM）。\n\n已确认无需 retry（SoftByDefault 且 FixableByAgents 非 finalizer）：Tier 2 ERM 4 种（ViolScalarCountUnsourced、ViolPathDepthInsufficient、ViolCardinalityShort、ViolEntityParityImbalanced）+ 永久 Soft 18 种，确认 Promotable=false 持续有效。\n\n需上游重做（非 finalizer retry 范畴）：FixableByAgents=[AgentExplorer/Extractor] 的 10 种 violation，需 explorer 或 extractor 重新调查，不属于 finalizer retry 评估范围。", "title": "建议保留/移除的 retry 清单"}], "citations": [{"file": "internal/types/violation_registry.go", "line": 68, "quote": "type ViolKindSpec struct {"}, {"file": "internal/types/violation_registry.go", "line": 563, "quote": "Kind: ViolAuthorityOverreach, DefaultSeverity: SeverityCritical,"}, {"file": "internal/types/violation_registry.go", "line": 644, "quote": "Kind: ViolMissingRequestedRoleUndisclosed, DefaultSeverity: SeverityHigh,"}, {"file": "internal/types/violation_registry.go", "line": 657, "quote": "Kind: ViolRichnessRegression, DefaultSeverity: SeveritySoft,"}, {"file": "internal/types/violation_registry.go", "line": 756, "quote": "Kind: ViolExhaustiveMemberSetCoverageDrift, DefaultSeverity: SeverityMedium,"}, {"file": "internal/types/violation_registry.go", "line": 938, "quote": "Kind: ViolEnumerationLabelHallucinated, DefaultSeverity: Severity